{
  "npcId": "weapon_master",
  "_comment": "The start story (docs/30 phase 3): the player tries the weapons (tryWeapon: a fight with a training slime), comes back to 'after' each time, and keeps one (chooseWeapon). Opened by the title's New Game.",
  "start": "intro",
  "nodes": {
    "intro": {
      "text": {
        "zh_TW": "æ‘å£ï¼Œä¸€ä½è€æ­¦å¸«æ””ä½äº†ä½ ï¼šã€Œè¦ä¸Šå¡”ï¼Ÿå…ˆæŒ‘ä¸€æŠŠè¶æ‰‹çš„å…µå™¨ã€‚æ‹¿æˆ‘çš„ç·´ç¿’å²èŠå§†è©¦è©¦ï¼Œä¸åˆæ‰‹å°±æ›ã€‚ã€",
        "en": "At the edge of the village an old weapon master stops you: \"Climbing the tower? Pick a weapon that fits your hand first. Try them on my training slime, and change if one does not suit you.\""
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": {
            "zh_TW": "è½è½å„ç¨®å…µå™¨ã€‚",
            "en": "Tell me about them."
