    "`setFlags` in a chapter/choice/floor to name a flag declared here, so this file is the contract",
    "for 'a flag exists'; the whole 8-choice arc is declared up front, and the phases that add acts",
    "4-10 only fill in content.",
    "scope: `run` = reset by a new game and by rebirth (section 9); `meta` = survives rebirth."
  ],
